---
import LearnLayout from "../../components/LearnLayout.astro";
---

<LearnLayout
  title="Find Anything: Command Palette & Search — Learn — cntxt"
  description="How cntxt's command palette searches across Projects, Groups, tabs, and session history."
  path="/learn/search"
>
  <a href="/learn" class="back-link">← Learn</a>
  <h1>Find anything: command palette & search</h1>
  <p>
    Press ⌘K to search across every Area, Project, and Group, and the tabs
    inside them — faster than scrolling a sidebar once you have more than a
    handful. The same palette also matches tabs from recent <a
      href="/learn/sessions">Sessions</a
    >.
  </p>
  <p>
    Today that session search only reaches the last 7 days, held in a local
    cache. A session older than that already exists in full further back,
    but doesn't surface in search yet.
  </p>

  <h2>Status</h2>
  <table class="status-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Capability</th><th>Status</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Command palette across Projects/Groups/Areas and their tabs</td>
        <td>🟢 Shipped</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Search across recent (last 7 days) session history</td>
        <td>🟢 Shipped</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Search across your full session history, not just recent</td>
        <td>🟡 In progress</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Display preferences (search scope, grid vs. list)</td>
        <td>🔴 Planned</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</LearnLayout>
